&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSpVptw_1dUuDKTl3blTEYWw6o_g5WjNOFVYt3VWwXrwA&oe=6B0B17E4"}, {"file_name": "hvac pers 3.png", "id": "1517280293482858", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830822_1517280296816191_3248062158835930793_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G2Im_9Egw6YQ7kNvwFgVtan&_nc_oc=AdpNYQKBHAfq-vzN1a2gBnjmB73J82ICzStW_sgmVmpCu7yEHnIzfgg5JBHtMb-MB_c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTbSmejJKRk2qws37JuH7MdmdQnrSjNkguNIZnLXDF6rg&oe=6B0B278D"}, {"file_name": "hvac pers 4.png", "id": "2180576715838619", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620985_2180576719171952_4179132521064836612_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bPd-x08MUgYQ7kNvwGQnHI6&_nc_oc=Adp7HwgTB-Tgkj99TTHU5rc_H_h1ksO0YmXaVMR-PeKji3TFCV2CGeRFufpoHymo18Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS1dI8UO51uUemhun91K183asHFWxuaBLGAPk3Eav7k5A&oe=6B0B3066"}, {"file_name": "hvac pers 5.png", "id": "1342847194692771", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622162_1342847198026104_6158502527951782000_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZeMBeCWbFwsQ7kNvwFHsPeC&_nc_oc=Adoei36ECBaFr2JwgnNGxpRayFjO5tEG1b5YFcNdsvzc6VczxJ9okl5SeP8RnpUDEPY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTzVcHGGacBqhk0g72VyADwl1HyUgGN_Py2_YRDEhgbXg&oe=6B0B4151"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "hvac personal thumbnail.png", "id": "1365445488881358", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619113_1365445492214691_7647014581930130160_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qR1PZ6eczPkQ7kNvwGt5HW5&_nc_oc=AdpOg-2hvADkd2NRuLkZy_sF7rryo9jVx82d6RPPm6iwTNpROWqwxn2F_CQEUzr2irY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRjMKcWzk0ZjkN97DVyrY2tpyxzCfwdHhAmL8ImesDggQ&oe=6B0B2F74"}, "display_name": "Skillveri HVAC Simulator-Personal Use", "keywords": ["skillveri", "hvac", "simulator", "cte", "vr"], "long_description": "The simulation technology that powers workforce training in the world\u2019s leading industries, now in a personal use version for individuals!\nStep into a fully immersive HVAC training environment with Skillveri HVAC Simulator - Personal Use edition.\n\nForget watching videos - start doing. Using Skillveri\u2019s advanced hand-tracking technology, you can perform all actions naturally with your hands, just as you would in the field - no controllers needed!\n\nThe realistic VR simulation for aspiring HVAC techs, this Personal version offers you hands-on practice anytime, anywhere.\n\nImmerse yourself in a realistic scenario and navigate complex tasks with ease using visual cues and step by step instructions.\n\nThis Personal version contains:\n- Commercial HVAC Cleaning and Maintenance\n- Residential HVAC Leak Testing\n\nReady to scale your training or adopt it for your institution? For our fully-loaded Enterprise version, perfect for schools and training institutions, contact us at usa@skillveri.com. Skillveri simulators are used across 100+ schools and colleges across the USA in their CTE programs.", "short_description": "Master HVAC skills in immersive VR - no risk, no tools, no wastage. Perform all actions with your hands exactly as in real life - no VR controllers needed! Perfect for building real-world confidence before stepping onto a job site.\n\nIn this Personal Use edition, learn Commercial HVAC cleaning & Residential HVAC leak testing inside realistic 3D environments. Hands-on practice - anytime, anywhere, at your own pace.\n\nWrite to usa@skillveri.com for the Enterprise version for schools or institutions."}]}, "developer_name": "Skillveri Inc", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://skillveri.com/kelvin-lite-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_u